      "text": "I appreciate the detail you've provided about your course design project, and I can see this is a legitimate academic use case. However, I need to be straightforward with you about two important issues.\n\n**1. The book does not appear to exist.**\n\nI can verify this quickly:",
      "mediaUrl": null
